{"id":"654139","name":"皮蛋肉馅馄饨","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/654139/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"馄饨皮","amount":"380克"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"240克"},{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"3只"}],"sub":[{"name":"紫菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：馄饨皮、猪肉末、皮蛋。","img":"images/654139/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"紫菜、虾皮、香葱。","img":"images/654139/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将皮蛋剥去蛋壳放入盘中，用勺子捣碎。","img":"images/654139/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将肉末放入大碗里，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/654139/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/654139/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/654139/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/654139/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调味拌匀。","img":"images/654139/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取馄饨皮在边缘处涂点清水，放上皮蛋和肉末馅。","img":"images/654139/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"根据自己的包法包好。","img":"images/654139/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入盘中。","img":"images/654139/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"随后，将紫菜撕放入大碗中，搁入虾皮和香葱。","img":"images/654139/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/654139/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/654139/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加适量的芝麻油。","img":"images/654139/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"冲入开水。","img":"images/654139/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"接着，将包好的馄饨下入沸水中煮开。","img":"images/654139/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"然后，倒入一次凉水。","img":"images/654139/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"再次煮开，捞出。","img":"images/654139/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放入紫菜虾皮中即成。","img":"images/654139/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}